---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout title="Hara blog" description="Official announcements, working notes, and community writing from Hara.">
  <main class="www-v2-main">
    <section class="www-v2-section" aria-labelledby="blog-title">
      <header class="www-v2-section-head">
        <div>
          <p class="hara-v2-kicker">Hara · blog</p>
          <h1 id="blog-title">Notes from the project.</h1>
        </div>
        <p>Short updates about the language, tools, people, and work around Hara.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="www-v2-learn__paths">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h2>Hara World archive</h2>
          <p>The existing reviewed announcements and community writing remain available while publication moves to the apex.</p>
          <a href="https://world.hara-lang.org/announcements/">Open announcements ↗</a>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h2>Write with the community</h2>
          <p>Profiles, projects, and public work will gradually become part of the WWW surface.</p>
          <a href="https://world.hara-lang.org/">Visit the archive ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
